/grants/policies/              /grants/rules-regs-policies/                    301
/grants/policies               /grants/rules-regs-policies/                    301

# External apps / sites — 301 REDIRECTS to other hosts (legacy window.location.href).
# The address bar CHANGES to the target. (Contrast with the proxied sub-sites below.)
/spac/                         https://spac.illinois.gov/                      301
/archive/                      https://archive.icjia.cloud/                    301
/intranet/                     https://intranet.icjia.cloud/                   301
/i2i/                          https://i2i.illinois.gov/                       301

# ── Proxied sub-sites ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Separate Netlify sites that must KEEP the icjia.illinois.gov URL. Status `200!` is a
# FORCE PROXY/REWRITE (not a redirect): the address bar stays icjia.illinois.gov/<app>/…
# while Netlify serves the sub-site's content. `:splat` forwards the rest of the path.
# Edge-level — evaluated BEFORE the Astro SSR function, and `!` forces precedence over
# it, so SSR is unaffected. More specific paths MUST be listed first (docs before app).
#
#   ADD A NEW SUB-SITE HERE: one line, a UNIQUE prefix that is NOT an Astro route:
#     /<prefix>/*   https://<their-netlify-site>/:splat   200!
/adultredeploy/*               https://adultredeploy.netlify.app/:splat          200!
/ifvcc/*                       https://ifvcc.netlify.app/:splat                   200!
/arrestexplorer/docs/*         https://arrest-docs.netlify.app/:splat            200!
/arrestexplorer/*              https://festive-meitner-0c6e7d.netlify.app/:splat  200!
/mhcontinuum/*                 https://mhcontinuum.netlify.app/:splat            200!
/sudcontinuum/*                https://sudcontinuum.netlify.app/:splat           200!
/researchhub/studio/*          https://researchhub-studio-next.netlify.app/:splat 200!

